        "original_id": "bbeaf212-9454-56f0-ac2e-d3f4c6a6e464",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Mark Ruffalo, Jennifer Garner, Josh Goldsmith, Cathy Yuspa, Gary Winick\n- Works: Shutter Island, The Kids Are All Right, 13 Going on 30\n- Companies: Revolution Studios, Columbia Pictures\n- Topics: film release, film production, film credits\n\nFacts:\n- 13 Going on 30 is a 2004 American romantic comedy fantasy film.\n- Josh Goldsmith and Cathy Yuspa wrote 13 Going on 30, and Gary Winick directed it.\n- Jennifer Garner starred in 13 Going on 30.\n- Revolution Studios produced 13 Going on 30 for Columbia Pictures.\n- 13 Going on 30 was released on April 23, 2004, and it was released as Suddenly 30 in some countries.\n- In 2010, Mark Ruffalo starred in the psychological thriller Shutter Island and the comedy-drama The Kids Are All Right.",
